A binary tree zipper needs:
- fromTree: create zipper from tree, focus on root
- toTree: get tree from zipper
- value: get value of focus node
- left: move focus to left child
- right: move focus to right child
- up: move focus to parent
- setValue: set value of focus node
- setLeft: set left child of focus node
- setRight: set right child of focus node

The tree structure: each node has a value, left, right.

