- Row above: (r-1, c-1) and (r-1, c) - actual positions (r-1, c-1+r-1) and (r-1, c+r-1) - correct
- Row below: (r+1, c) and (r+1, c+1) - actual positions (r+1, c+r+1) and (r+1, c+1+r+1) - correct

